# 2026-07-04 06:58:17.438207
+Improve error handling in sarmkadan/dotnet-service-scaffold.
+Work in: /home/redrocket/task-factory/workdir/dotnet-service-scaffold
+
+1. Review the main service classes for error handling gaps
+2. Add custom exception types in an Exceptions/ folder:
+   - DotnetServiceScaffoldException (base)
+   - ConfigurationException
+   - ValidationException (if applicable)
